# Ask whether the last cut fruit ended up in the crate.
#
# Implemented by whatever can see the crate: the simulator reads the fruit's
# position back from Gazebo; a real robot would use a crate camera or a load cell.
# The mission treats a missing service as "not verified", not as a failed pick.
---
bool in_crate
string detail                 # for the log, e.g. the measured position or why it could not be told
